From d6d2982358c9eade9036735edee43061097fc733 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: adeesababa <rkwastavich@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 12:27:33 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] NVR extension rtlamp: cube-gradient samples in pixel
 shaders become ray queries against the RT core's TLAS

ID3D9NvrExtRtLamp switches the hook; src/dxvk/dxvk_nvr_rtpatch.* rewrites a lowered fragment shader's
SPIR-V (every OpImageSampleExplicitLod with Grad on a cube image -> one opaque ray query, TLAS address baked
via OpConvertUToAccelerationStructureKHR). The TLAS owner calls nvrRtSetTlas(address, cameraRelative).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
